      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "Although the report contained useful findings, its conclusion was narrower than the headline suggested. Despite the confident wording, the researchers had not compared every form of education. Sara checked the publication date and looked for independent coverage. Repetition across several websites did not necessarily mean independent confirmation.",
        "zh": "尽管报告有一些有用发现，结论范围却比标题暗示的窄。措辞虽很肯定，研究人员并没有比较所有教育形式。萨拉检查发表日期，并寻找独立报道。多个网站重复同样信息，不一定意味着独立证实。",
        "start": 101.28,
